  Control Plane Panel - The Metamorphic UI Controls

  OPUS-031 Layer 1.5: Bidirectional Control Surface

  This panel provides toggle controls for OPUS.md sections.
  Human edits to checkboxes are parsed by ControlCablesParser
  and persisted to StateManager before the next render.

  THE DOCUMENT IS THE API.

  Required context:
    - session.view_preferences: Dict[str, Any]
    - karma.current_score: float
    - health_status: str
    - treasury (optional): DailySpend data

  Design Decisions (OPUS-031):
    - DD4: Bidirectional Control Surface - OPUS.md is INPUT, not just OUTPUT
    - DD5: Configuration, Not Commands - Settings persist until changed
#}

